ifter can take on the most perilous routes and reach the mysterious Citadel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1017160/extras/ce4d2ab83ff3062a3ae8764398f38401.poster.avif?t=1761612741\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1017160/extras/ce4d2ab83ff3062a3ae8764398f38401.webm?t=1761612741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1017160/extras/ce4d2ab83ff3062a3ae8764398f38401.mp4?t=1761612741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced top-down vehicle combat with tight, responsive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-lite progression with random routes, enemies, and gear unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 deadly factions and mega-boss battles across 9 zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ upgradeable parts to customize your combat car</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty modes, including permadeath for the fearless</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Red Phantom Games"],"dlc":[1631300,1761590],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1017160/header.jpg?t=1761612741","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2021 Red Phantom Games Limited. All rights reserved. Licensed to and published by Numskull Games Limited. \"Gearshifters\" is a trademark of Red Phantom Games Limited.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\